      "writtenOn": "2022-09-01T23:25:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `-label:Code-Coverage\u003dMIN` part is true for most/all CLs. since it\u0027s an `OR` not an `AND`. e.g. on this example https://crrev.com/c/3863941\n\n```\ngob-curl -X POST -H \u0027Content-Type: application/json; charset\u003dUTF-8\u0027 -d \u0027{\"name\": \"Code-Coverage\", \"submittability_expression\": \"label:Code-Coverage\u003dMAX,user\u003dnon_uploader OR -label:Code-Coverage\u003dMIN\"}\u0027 https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/a/changes/chromiumos%2Fplatform%2Fec~main~I57de9f35b85b8f3c7119df36aefb2abf25d2625f/check.submit_requirement\n)]}\u0027\n{\"name\":\"Code-Coverage\",\"status\":\"SATISFIED\",\"is_legacy\":false,\"submittability_expression_result\":{\"expression\":\"label:Code-Coverage\\u003dMAX,user\\u003dnon_uploader OR -label:Code-Coverage\\u003dMIN\",\"fulfilled\":true,\"status\":\"PASS\",\"passing_atoms\":[],\"failing_atoms\":[\"label:Code-Coverage\\u003dMAX,user\\u003dnon_uploader\",\"label:Code-Coverage\\u003dMIN\"]}}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "b285452b_1bff4954",
      "revId": "4ce70ae9fb8ef64644c5fa80eff2599764ff512c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
